PRINTL
DRAWLINE
PRINTLC [100] 됐어
PRINTL
DRAWLINE
WHILE 1
INPUT
SELECTCASE RESULT
	CASE 0 TO 99
		TRYCALLFORM k1011Help_{RESULT}
